UPDATE public.sondas_config SET question_text_en = $rsv$Facing uncertainty, the unknown, or outcomes you cannot control, how does your mental processor operate?$rsv$, options_json_en = to_jsonb(json_build_array(json_build_object('label',$rsv$Paralysis by Fear. I live imagining the worst catastrophic scenarios. My body is tense 24/7, bracing for an attack that only exists in my mind.$rsv$,'value',0), json_build_object('label',$rsv$Chronic Worry. My mind races at a thousand miles an hour. I spend enormous amounts of energy trying to control every variable so I can feel "safe."$rsv$,'value',25), json_build_object('label',$rsv$Operational Anxiety. I function, but I get frustrated and rattled when plans drift off my schedule. I struggle to trust the process.$rsv$,'value',50), json_build_object('label',$rsv$Strategic Trust. I do my part, design the structure, and execute with precision, but I release my attachment to the exact outcome. I adapt fast to any detour.$rsv$,'value',75), json_build_object('label',$rsv$Surrender to the Void. The future is clay. There is no friction, because I understand that uncertainty is the canvas of creation. I operate in absolute certainty.$rsv$,'value',100))::text) WHERE id = '53c1ea1a-1d14-4612-ab58-322847713812';
