UPDATE public.sondas_config SET question_text_en = $rsv$How much does the number in your bank account define your sense of success, inner peace, and worth as an Avatar?$rsv$, options_json_en = to_jsonb(json_build_array(json_build_object('label',$rsv$Identity enslavement. "I am my bank account." If the number drops, I get depressed and collapse. If it rises, my ego inflates with temporary superiority.$rsv$,'value',0), json_build_object('label',$rsv$Numerical anxiety. Checking my finances gives me heart palpitations or stress. I avoid looking at my numbers because facing them causes me pain or panic.$rsv$,'value',25), json_build_object('label',$rsv$Logical separation. I understand intellectually that I am not my finances, but my day-to-day mood still fluctuates slightly depending on my sales or income.$rsv$,'value',50), json_build_object('label',$rsv$Operational detachment. I see money for what it is: a three-dimensional tool. I have low-liquidity days and I don't lose my peace or doubt my vision.$rsv$,'value',75), json_build_object('label',$rsv$The Player and the Board. Absolute sovereignty. The numbers are just telemetry on the screen of my ship. My worth is unshakable and my peace is constant, whether I have 100 dollars or 10 million.$rsv$,'value',100))::text) WHERE id = 'e5d732b9-7d22-45d0-b1ce-abde8e17d307';
