UPDATE public.sondas_config SET question_text_en = $rsv$If your current cash flow suddenly multiplied by 10 (a quantum leap in income), how would the architecture of your system react?$rsv$, options_json_en = to_jsonb(json_build_array(json_build_object('label',$rsv$Unconscious sabotage. I would feel guilty. I would believe that "money corrupts" or that I'd lose my people. Unconsciously I would create a problem to get rid of the money.$rsv$,'value',0), json_build_object('label',$rsv$Structural panic. The responsibility and the taxes would scare me. I wouldn't know what to do with so much energy and I'd freeze out of fear of losing it or making bad decisions.$rsv$,'value',25), json_build_object('label',$rsv$Bottleneck. I would want the money, but my operating system (taxes, management, banks) isn't ready to process that load. It would stall.$rsv$,'value',50), json_build_object('label',$rsv$Fluid expansion. My system is ready. I have the legal, mental, and emotional structure to receive the quantum leap and channel that energy toward my vision.$rsv$,'value',75), json_build_object('label',$rsv$Abundance singularity. My biology already lives at the frequency of those millions. When the money arrives in matter, there's no surprise or shock, only the natural collapse of a wave function I had already designed.$rsv$,'value',100))::text) WHERE id = '28363988-b5be-4c1e-8acc-40edf18437cc';
