UPDATE public.sondas_config SET question_text_en = $rsv$While you're awake, how do you manage your mental "RAM" against the avalanche of stimuli from the matrix?$rsv$, options_json_en = to_jsonb(json_build_array(json_build_object('label',$rsv$Total Fragmentation. I'm addicted to cheap dopamine. My attention jumps every 10 seconds. I can't stand silence and I can't hold a deep thought without reaching for my phone.$rsv$,'value',0), json_build_object('label',$rsv$Chronic Overload. I try to focus, but I have 20 "tabs" open in my mind. I work with constant interruptions and reach the end of the day with severe mental fatigue.$rsv$,'value',25), json_build_object('label',$rsv$Conditioned Function. I reach a functional focus under pressure or with deadlines, but in my free time my mind fills with static and I look for passive distractions.$rsv$,'value',50), json_build_object('label',$rsv$Protected Focus. I operate in blocks of deep work. I consume information consciously, block distractions, and sink into silence without resistance.$rsv$,'value',75), json_build_object('label',$rsv$Operational Emptiness (Laser Focus). My mind is an anechoic chamber (total silence). It only processes when I give it the command to execute. Zero static. My attention is a single-point vector.$rsv$,'value',100))::text) WHERE id = 'a99bd482-0038-493b-a6bb-2c3a502b3156';
