UPDATE public.sondas_config SET question_text_en = $rsv$What percentage of your mental bandwidth is spent calculating the future or reviewing the past?$rsv$, options_json_en = to_jsonb(json_build_array(json_build_object('label',$rsv$Analysis Paralysis. My mind is a broken time machine. I live in a constant loop of catastrophic scenarios that haven't happened or regrets I can't change.$rsv$,'value',0), json_build_object('label',$rsv$Frequent Rumination. I overthink every variable. It's extremely hard to anchor my processor on the present task because my mind is always on "what's next".$rsv$,'value',25), json_build_object('label',$rsv$Operational Thinking. I project the future to plan the logistics of my life; sometimes it creates tension, but I eventually manage to bring my attention back to the present.$rsv$,'value',50), json_build_object('label',$rsv$High Presence. Most of the day, my mind is exactly where my physical body is. I use the past as a library and the future as a compass, but I don't live in them.$rsv$,'value',75), json_build_object('label',$rsv$Absolute Anchoring. Total sovereignty over the present timeline. Pure observation and aligned action. The mind doesn't travel without my explicit authorization.$rsv$,'value',100))::text) WHERE id = '1007e764-491a-40fe-9de7-8c3779864d1b';
