UPDATE public.sondas_config SET question_text_en = $rsv$When you're with the person you spend the most time with, how does the energy of the relationship feel?$rsv$, options_json_en = to_jsonb(json_build_array(json_build_object('label',$rsv$Total drain. My closest bond is a black hole: arguments, toxicity, or disconnection. My energy collapses when I'm near them.$rsv$,'value',0), json_build_object('label',$rsv$Latent friction. There's love, but we run on different frequencies. I feel I have to "pull" the other person along or dim my light so I don't make them uncomfortable.$rsv$,'value',25), json_build_object('label',$rsv$Mechanical companionship. We function well and share routines, but the relationship is peaceful without a spark, without depth or growing together.$rsv$,'value',50), json_build_object('label',$rsv$Active resonance. We grow together: conscious communication, support for each other's projects, and deep respect for the other's freedom.$rsv$,'value',75), json_build_object('label',$rsv$Field multiplier. When we're together we don't add up, we multiply. The other's presence raises my Light Index.$rsv$,'value',100))::text) WHERE id = '068eed21-cbc8-4aed-8f84-59ab19c65437';
